# Termination Notice Period

Calculates the date by which the agreement can be terminated following a failure to comply.

```catala
declaration scope TerminationNotice:
  input date_of_failure content date
  output termination_date content date
```

## Termination Notice Period

The termination date is calculated by adding two months to the date of failure.

```catala
scope TerminationNotice:
  date round down
  definition termination_date equals date_of_failure + 2 month
```